{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_004_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4be9430670b814f93236e9849a029cd2846f36d3bb64235f565673cc6183560d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_22:5_02_004_22_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1945e06e49e4e152433ea7b8589b14601192168a9fa75a111abe7031199917bf",
      "text": "哟！●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_22:5_02_004_22_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b70c055569f9ba54328ffa95026d2dcc60c229d5b520d7ba09886f342291fb7",
      "text": "太好了，我刚好正在找你呢。\n这个，想交给你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_22:5_02_004_22_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d89cb1dfcfc2c6275d1c76b40a947f09a637fe140610623c8dbc4d2377dcd55",
      "text": "前阵子情人节的时候，\n你不是送我巧克力了嘛？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_22:5_02_004_22_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93276fda094bdb0171867d931da1b223d242793bbf622542b84cce96f7926717",
      "text": "这是回礼哦。\n别客气，快收下吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_22:5_02_004_22_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f93687dea02647a2ad56b7c637c8115f2bfb901f40fa7b943cb62cda4930ec7",
      "text": "你要是能开心的话我就很高兴了。\n那么，回头见啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_22:5_02_004_22_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:218705ced529df3689525df94b409fab4ec0a15726d64c2748735a8addaf8a0f",
      "text": "哟，●●●●プロデューサー！\n辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_22:5_02_004_22_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01569fa7c33fb8c7b62c22ba902e5657e4feec70f4c25aa604588a102e26a0de",
      "text": "今天不是白色情人节嘛？其实我正想把回礼\n交给你，一直在找你呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_22:5_02_004_22_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0dc06c8def59877c42bd931327adee6713a538860e48371a935a3601bcddfae5",
      "text": "这个，不嫌弃的话就收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_22:5_02_004_22_b:cmd-000029:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccb914c1968a0768da834c6b4ea69b7f2f0c765aaa81d4e6c64126d995d67f7f",
      "text": "非常感谢！好开心",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_22:5_02_004_22_b:cmd-000030:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8d8b2c931002be966f83a58f9fc854193ebea9ac18acb4dee3388ea4d88792c",
      "text": "居然能收到辉先生的回礼，太令人感动了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_22:5_02_004_22_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7275b7200fbee2a861309086045525abe5b69ef5884f167dfc3708958fcb081",
      "text": "哈哈，看来你挺喜欢的，\n这下我就放心啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_22:5_02_004_22_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4a0ebcb628c694f7d38d8dc47b6188d8b48901f11bae24d5211868602d55f76",
      "text": "我啊，收到你送的巧克力时，\n真的超级高兴呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_22:5_02_004_22_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df20be228f0611b605802bc1991ddafff10e91731c423955cf201515eb614446",
      "text": "要是能把当时的那份心情原封不动地回赠给你\n就好了，我是怀着这样的想法挑出来的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_22:5_02_004_22_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efe3327e030f9aaa50c11ea0642c0fb946f3f524cdae717366ca8efc7eaa5d4e",
      "text": "所以，在送什么上面我可是相当认真地琢磨过哦？\n虽然里面装了什么现在还是秘密，不过我想你一定会喜欢的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_22:5_02_004_22_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06b7241a7dd7b1b1d1ebd8555de8c3242f05a99b3d9d87271d366eb78fc12b88",
      "text": "从今往后……也许有时我还会给你添上\n各种各样的麻烦也说不定。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_22:5_02_004_22_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80ce8f19c51498bc94a01356c61f1a5bb51c1f77ac4bc0968b5980956e9c1386",
      "text": "不过为了能像今天这样让你展露笑容，\n我会加油的。请多指教啦，制作人！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
